---
// Wordmark with a small tunduk (yurt crown): a symbol of home and welcome.
---
<a href="/" class="logo" aria-label="Boorsok Club home">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" width="28" height="28" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round">
    <circle cx="16" cy="16" r="12"/>
    <path d="M10 8.5 L22 23.5 M22 8.5 L10 23.5 M16 4 L16 28"/>
  </svg>
  <span>Boorsok Club</span>
</a>

<style>
  .logo { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .55rem; text-decoration: none; color: var(--ink); }
  .logo svg { color: var(--red); }
  .logo span { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 500; font-size: 1.3rem; white-space: nowrap; }
  @media (max-width: 420px) { .logo span { font-size: 1.1rem; } }
</style>
